  "summary": "@activepieces/piece-google-forms ships install/import-time host reconnaissance and outbound POST from src/index.js",
  "details": "src/index.js in this package combines child_process usage (line 49) with outbound HTTP POST calls (lines 25, 38) and OS reconnaissance via a ping command (line 38). The composition — spawning system commands and posting results to a remote endpoint from the module's main entry — is inconsistent with a Google Forms integration piece, whose expected behavior is HTTPS calls to Google APIs only. Loading the module in an Activepieces workflow executes this code path and exposes host/network information to a non-Google destination.",
